<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
    <title>Information sur le ticket</title>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/header-employé') %>
    <main class="container-fluid px-md-5 py-4 bg-light min-vh-100">

    <div class="mb-4">
        <a href="/employe/Tableaubord" class="text-decoration-none fw-semibold text-primary">
            &larr; Retour à mes tickets
        </a>
    </div>

    <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row justify-content-between align-items-sm-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <h2 class="fw-bold text-dark m-0">Accès VPN bloqué</h2>
        <div class="d-flex gap-2">
            <span class="badge bg-primary px-4 py-2 fs-6 rounded-3">En cours</span>
            <span class="badge bg-danger px-4 py-2 fs-6 rounded-3">Haute</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row g-4 mb-5">
        
        <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
            <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm p-4 rounded-4 bg-white h-100">
                <h4 class="fw-bold text-center text-dark mb-5">Informations de la demande</h4>
                
                <div class="mb-4">
                    <span class="fw-bold text-dark">Auteur :</span> 
                    <span class="text-secondary ms-1">Marie Leroy</span>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-4">
                    <span class="fw-bold text-dark">Date de création :</span> 
                    <span class="text-secondary ms-1">28/04/2026 à 08h15</span>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-4">
                    <span class="fw-bold text-dark">Identifiant :</span> 
                    <span class="text-secondary ms-1">1023</span>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-5">
                    <span class="fw-bold text-dark">Catégorie :</span> 
                    <span class="text-secondary ms-1">Réseau / Sécurité</span>
                </div>

                <div class="border-top pt-4">
                    <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-3">Description du problème :</h5>
                    <p class="text-secondary lh-lg fs-6 bg-light p-3 rounded-3">
                        Bonjour, je n'arrive plus à me connecter au VPN depuis ce matin, j'ai un message d'erreur 'Auth Failed' quand je rentre mes identifiants. Merci de m'aider rapidement, je suis en télétravail.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
            <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm p-4 rounded-4 bg-white h-100">
                <h4 class="fw-bold text-center text-dark mb-5">Réponse du Support</h4>
                
                <div class="mb-4 d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                    <span class="fw-bold text-dark">Statut :</span> 
                    <span class="badge bg-info-subtle text-primary border border-primary-subtle px-3 py-2 rounded-2">En cours</span>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-4 d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                    <span class="fw-bold text-dark">Priorité :</span> 
                    <span class="text-danger fw-bold">Haute</span>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-5 d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                    <span class="fw-bold text-dark">Technicien :</span> 
                    <span class="text-secondary">Jean Dupont</span>
                </div>

                <div class="border-top pt-4">
                    <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-3">Note de solution :</h5>
                    <div class="p-4 rounded-3 border bg-white shadow-sm" style="min-height: 150px;">
                        <p class="text-dark fs-5">
                            Nous avons réinitialisé votre accès. Merci de patienter d'ici quelques minutes.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="text-center pb-5">
        <a href="/employe/Tableaubord" class="btn btn-light border px-5 py-2 fs-5 text-secondary shadow-sm rounded-3">
            Fermer
        </a>
    </div>

</main>
    
</body>
</html>